  "briefing": "The Crucible has fortified the metal fields of the Ashfall Plains with turret outposts. Take them back. Their Light Turrets outrange your tanks, so bring Mortar Bots or Artillery to crack them from a distance. Expect the foundry in the south-east to answer every outpost you burn.",
