    "Three Crucible outposts sit on our metal. The nearest is on the ridge, north-east of base.",
    "Their turrets outrange Striders. Lead with Mortar Bots, then roll in.",
    "Ridge outpost burned. That metal is ours again.",
    "Kiln Field burned. That metal is ours again.",
    "Cinder Flats burned. That metal is ours again.",
    "Crucible raiders leaving the foundry. Heading your way.",
    "Anvils inbound from the south-east.",
    "Another column moving. Mortars this time.",
    "Heavy column with artillery. Meet it before it sets up.",
    "The foundry is answering. Three Anvils.",
    "Retaliation column inbound.",
    "The plains are ours. Every extractor out there now feeds the network."
